输出；作用：接收 CLIP 编码器对象，用于把提示词编码成条件向量；范围：CLIP 编码器对象（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 244], "pos": [410, 248], "id": 17, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#5 ConditioningZeroOut\n作用：把条件输入置空/弱化，减少条件干扰。\n参数：\n- conditioning：当前值=来自 节点#4 CLIPTextEncode 的 `CONDITIONING` 输出；作用：接收上游 `conditioning` 连线输入；范围：CONDITIONING 类型数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 190], "pos": [820, 188], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#6 VAEDecode\n作用：将采样 latent 解码为可视图像。\n参数：\n- samples：当前值=来自 节点#7 KSampler 的 `LATENT` 输出；作用：接收待处理 latent 样本（如待解码或待上采样的数据）；范围：latent 数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- vae：当前值=来自 节点#2 VAELoader 的 `VAE` 输出；作用：接收 VAE 对象，用于像素图像与 latent 之间转换；范围：VAE 对象（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 262], "pos": [1640, 188], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#7 KSampler\n作用：核心采样器：按步数/采样器/调度器将噪声迭代为目标 latent。\n参数：\n- seed：当前值=375303073580744；作用：随机种子，控制可复现性；范围：整数，常见 0 ~ 2^63-1；默认：0。\n- control_after_generate：当前值=randomize；作用：每次生成后对种子的处理策略；范围：固定/随机/递增等枚举值；默认：fixed。\n- steps：当前值=4；作用：采样步数，步数越高通常细节越充分；范围：整数，常见 1 ~ 150；默认：20。\n- cfg：当前值=1；作用：提示词引导强度；范围：浮点，常见 0.0 ~ 30.0；默认：7.0。\n- sampler_name：当前值=euler；作用：采样算法类型；范围：下拉枚举（如 euler / dpm / sa_solver）；默认：euler。\n- scheduler：当前值=simple；作用：噪声调度策略；范围：下拉枚举（normal / karras / beta 等）；默认：normal。\n- denoise：当前值=1；作用：去噪强度；1 表示完整重绘；范围：浮点 0.0 ~ 1.0；默认：1.0。\n- model：当前值=来自 节点#1 UNETLoader 的 `MODEL` 输出；作用：接收上游模型对象（具体是扩散模型、姿态模型或检测模型由该节点类型决定）；范围：模型对象（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- positive：当前值=来自 节点#4 CLIPTextEncode 的 `CONDITIONING` 输出；作用：接收正向条件向量，告诉模型“应该生成什么”；范围：CONDITIONING 类型数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- negative：当前值=来自 节点#5 ConditioningZeroOut 的 `CONDITIONING` 输出；作用：接收负向条件向量，告诉模型“尽量避免什么”；范围：CONDITIONING 类型数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- latent_image：当前值=来自 节点#11 EmptyLatentImage 的 `LATENT` 输出；作用：接收起始 latent 画布或中间 latent 结果，作为采样输入底稿；范围：latent 数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 910], "pos": [1230, 310], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#9 SaveImage\n作用：保存图像到输出目录并生成文件名前缀。\n参数：\n- filename_prefix：当前值=Ernie-Image-Turbo-4steps；作用：输出文件名前缀；范围：字符串（文件系统合法字符）；默认：ComfyUI。\n- images：当前值=来自 节点#6 VAEDecode 的 `IMAGE` 输出；作用：接收图像序列输入（可是一张图或多帧批次）；范围：图像数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 226], "pos": [2050, 411], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#11 EmptyLatentImage\n作用：创建空白 latent 画布，相当于先定好画布尺寸。\n参数：\n- width：当前值=768；作用：控制输出尺寸与清晰度；改大更清晰但更耗时、更占显存；范围：整数或预设分辨率档位（常见 256 ~ 4096）；默认：1024（常见）。\n- height：当前值=1280；作用：控制输出尺寸与清晰度；改大更清晰但更耗时、更占显存；范围：整数或预设分辨率档位（常见 256 ~ 4096）；默认：1024（常见）。\n- batch_size：当前值=1；作用：一次生成的图片数量；范围：整数，常见 1 ~ 16；默认：1。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 298], "pos": [0, 188], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#13 PrimitiveStringMultiline\n作用：输出多行字符串常量，通常作为提示词模板或说明文本供下游节点复用。\n参数：\n- value：当前值=这是一张融合中国传统宋代院体画美学与1920年代上海美术电影制片厂黑白动画风格的视觉信息图，主题为…；作用：多行文本内容本体，通常写提示词模板或固定说明；范围：多行字符串（长度由节点限制）；默认：空字符串。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 208], "pos": [0, 1867], "id": 23, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [2973.1748046875, 4142.5], "pos": [-3073.914794921875, 0], "widgets_values": ["5ea7b6dddd00c759948ac5990f2255e6d9464063ed0de5d84e6a4cd840029a69.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [89], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["殷紫萍——济世仙医的花间灵息。A serene, highly-detailed cinematic portrait of Yin Ziping the \"Celestial Physician\" from Naraka: Bladepoint, in the luminous, soft-focus style of a Pre-Raphaelite painting by John William Waterhouse. She kneels by a crystalline stream in a sun-drenched, wildflower meadow, cupping clear water in her delicate hands. Her attire is a vision of pastoral elegance: a flowing layered dress of pale lavender and seafoam green silks, intricately embroidered with wisteria flowers and medicinal herbs, with sheer, billowy sleeves that catch the breeze. Her expression is one of gentle, compassionate concentration, with soft, natural pink tones on her cheeks. The composition is a medium close-up that fills the frame with a sea of out-of-focus flowers. The masterful lighting is the dappled, warm sunlight breaking through the canopy of an ancient wisteria tree overhead, creating a complex, ever-shifting pattern of light and shadow on her face and the water. The water she holds glows with a faint, golden healing energy. The hyper-realistic detail is in the individual pollen grains clinging to the fine hairs on her arm and the intricate veins on the flower petals."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [240, 727], "pos": [0, 1092], "id": 13, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.9.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 15}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [960.8018901601447, 723.8447974714288], "scale": 0.25937424601000086}}, "groups": [], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 4, 0, "CLIP"], [2, 4, 0, 5, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [3, 7, 0, 6, 0, "LATENT"], [4, 2, 0, 6, 1, "VAE"], [5, 1, 0, 7, 0, "MODEL"], [6, 4, 0, 7, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [7, 5, 0, 7, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [9, 6, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [10, 11, 0, 7, 3, "LATENT"], [89, 13, 0, 4, 1, "STRING"]], "id": "21c811f2-6e39-44f0-ae03-da34f8f13381", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 24, "revision": 0}